[{"client_msg_id":"fc85ea1c-20e1-4a14-a373-76ad45d250a7","type":"message","user":"UBNPMJJGM","text":"というかこの記法、Matzが認めないだろうと思ってたのでびっくりしている","ts":"1631371209.059900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1HZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7b238d47-faa3-4817-9a37-514396427ea5","type":"message","user":"UBNPMJJGM","text":"`x`、 `y` は変数で成り立つことを確認していて、 `one`、 `two` はメソッドでも同様に成り立つことを確認しているんだと思います","ts":"1631371165.059300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D4jBg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a22dd00a-4d97-403e-b348-1d32be3fc939","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"Rubyこういうシンタックスシュガー豊富で羨ましい。\n追加されたテストの `def one` と `def two` は何のテストなんだろう？？\n\u003chttps://github.com/ruby/ruby/commit/c60dbcd1c55cd77a24c41d5e1a9555622be8b2b8\u003e","ts":"1631357936.055900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nGnq9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f7f42a8f-cda9-436a-b957-e193bc71cff8","type":"message","user":"U01PQE8LNE9","text":"shellは0がtrueで1がfalse (?)","ts":"1631343916.055500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QU2xc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9ec000be-8318-4d14-bf6e-2cca1aed580f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Ruby がまさに 0 が true な言語ですね","ts":"1631336948.055200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=F72S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e23b0c7c-ca28-476f-908d-64f762348d61","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"0がfalseな例はvim script","ts":"1631333961.054800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AkX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"88e29aaa-f3f4-4009-b08b-1c8d0f5f1d4e","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"最近触ってる言語たいていは0がtrueだ","ts":"1631333917.054100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=WU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fae80cff-059e-4001-92ea-a1819b498438","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u0026gt; 世の中には0がtrueの言語もあってだな\nElisp!\n```(if 0 t nil)\n;;=\u0026gt; t```","ts":"1631333880.053500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"ultrafastparrot","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E1q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"27a66ba1-4533-413d-a785-96dc75900e38","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ほんとはtruthy/falsyみたいな概念を入れるんじゃなくて、bool系演算子の結果だけ、のほうが安心なんだけどね....むずかしい","ts":"1631331791.053000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NTlY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a313c2f0-df70-45f6-b93b-fe27e19d170a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"厳密に判定したい気持ちはわかる(というかJSでも癖で等号書いてるな)","ts":"1631330388.052200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rWtO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1ba063f4-73fc-46be-a1d4-a8a70a213fac","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"~世の中には0がtrueの言語もあってだな~","ts":"1631330363.051700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cNs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c3a15942-8def-45d8-91d4-3e6e2be957b8","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"PHP で == 使うのが不安。みたいな気持ちと同じやつ。","ts":"1631330029.051400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s6iwz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"605f323a-76d9-41f7-9443-9d72727d8858","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"モニョっていた理由はまさに言語によっては 0 が falsy じゃないので「危険な行いをしているかも」という感覚が去来してたんだと思います。","ts":"1631329994.050800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bYqW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5632a50-581f-41c4-bc5a-4ae69e55af8c","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"最初は arr.length !== 0 を使ってました。","ts":"1631329917.049400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nPE6Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"10c44159-7647-4c04-8454-0f5d144cd5b2","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"(まあ、JS の例はもう自分の中でイディオム扱いになったのでモニョらなくなりましたが)","ts":"1631329896.048700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eXyk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"050b2efb-b262-489a-9919-aef05c6ff019","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"まさにそこが言語化したいなあというポイントでした。0 って falsy でもおかしくない値って(自分は)考えており、そこに ? がつくと「boolean 返るんだろうな」って安心感がプラスされていいなぁと思ったんですよね。\nJS で arr.length による判定書くときもちょっとモニョっていたのが、うまい具合に解決されてるなぁと。","ts":"1631329744.047700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YWh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9ede35db-0f2e-443f-a52e-b9b11987e95c","type":"message","user":"U01PQE8LNE9","text":"0がfalsyな言語を使ってきたどうかで受け取り方が変わりそう (じゃあ何でRubyにsize?が生えとるんやという感じもする)","ts":"1631305036.042900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QJAeD"}]}]
